| 24 | `semantics/builtins.k:25` | `rule` | — | `unused-fixed` | Top symbol/construct is unreachable from this target; cannot contribute to either claim. | `rule seqLen(setV(DS:IntSeq))                  =&gt; isLen(DS)` |
| 25 | `semantics/builtins.k:26` | `rule` | — | `unused-fixed` | Top symbol/construct is unreachable from this target; cannot contribute to either claim. | `rule seqLen(rangeObj(LO:Int, HI:Int, ST:Int)) =&gt; rangeLen(LO, HI, ST)` |
| 26 | `semantics/builtins.k:32` | `rule` | — | `unused-fixed` | Top symbol/construct is unreachable from this target; cannot contribute to either claim. | `rule &lt;k&gt; #applyK(toCall(builtinV("list")), (list(VS:ValSeq),  .Vals)) =&gt; #alloc(list(VS)) ... &lt;/k&gt;` |
